# lang.js — Internationalization System
# File: data/lang.js

## PURPOSE
Translation system for all UI text. Two languages: English (en), German (de).

## STRUCTURE
const TRANSLATIONS = { en: { key: "text", ... }, de: { key: "text", ... } }
~2200 translation keys total.

## API
- setLanguage(langCode): Set and persist to localStorage.puck_lang
- getTranslation(key): Lookup in current language, fallback to English
- applyTranslations(): Apply to all elements with data-i18n="key" attribute
- currentLang: loaded from localStorage.puck_lang, default 'en'

## KEY PREFIXES
- g_*: Game titles (g_shuttle, g_simon, g_beep, etc.)
- desc_*: Game descriptions
- setup_*: Game setup instructions
- ex_*: Game examples
- img_*: Game image filenames
- ps_*: Player statistics keys
- tm_*: Training Manager keys
- pp_*: Player Picker keys
- pm_*: Player Manager keys

## USAGE IN HTML
<span data-i18n="key_name"></span>
applyTranslations() called on page load replaces innerText.
